    {
      "kind": "section",
      "role": "contrast",
      "title": "Focusing on What, When, or Where",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "When the focused part is not the subject, Norwegian often continues with a normal clause. A clause is a group of words with a subject and a finite verb. After the focused object, time, or place, the subject usually comes before that finite verb."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "rule",
          "statement": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Non-subject focus: "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "Det er",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": " or "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "det var",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": " + focused object, time, or place + subject + finite verb."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "example",
          "no": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Det er kaffe jeg vil ha."
            }
          ],
          "en": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "It is coffee I want."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "example",
          "no": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Det er i Bergen hun studerer."
            }
          ],
          "en": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "It is in Bergen she studies."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "example",
          "no": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Det var på mandag vi fikk svaret."
            }
          ],
          "en": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "It was on Monday we got the answer."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "callout",
          "level": "warning",
